OL,3,ASwedish military seeks to take over
OL,4,ARussian-owned estate near naval base
OL,5,
OL,6,FSweden's armed forces have asked the
OL,7,Fgovernment to expropriate a
OL,8,FRussia-owned property near a naval base
OL,9,Fon security grounds.
OL,11,FThe military requested the seizure of
OL,12,Fthe beach plot near Musko base in
OL,13,FStockholm archipelago, citing "the
OL,14,Fthreat from Russian drones and the
OL,15,Fownership situation of the property".
OL,17,FSwedish reports say a businessman with
OL,18,Flinks to the Russian state, has been
OL,19,Fbuilding a luxury house on Musko island
OL,20,F` although his wife, who holds both
OL,21,FRussian and Swedish citizenship, is the
OL,22,Fregistered owner.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
